      "title": "RunPod templates and manual provisioning",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# RunPod templates\n\nMiniMax H3 FL2VA and Ref2VA each have two RunPod templates:\n\n- **Plus tail:** provisions the H3 generation tail.\n- **Plus QWEN prompt enhancer:** provisions the local Qwen3.8 GGUF prompt enhancer used by this workflow.\n\n## FL2VA\n\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 FL2VA plus tail](https://console.runpod.io/deploy?template=v7b5g03csk&ref=se4tkc5o)\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 FL2VA plus prompt enhancer](https://console.runpod.io/hub/template/a1nkufhzxq?ref=se4tkc5o)\n\n## Ref2VA\n\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 Ref2VA plus tail](https://console.runpod.io/deploy?template=6qtfx7lxgc&ref=se4tkc5o)\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 Ref2VA plus prompt enhancer](https://console.runpod.io/hub/template/pcsqepl6kt?ref=se4tkc5o)\n\n# Manual Qwen3.8 prompt-enhancer download\n\nThe **plus prompt enhancer** template provisions these files automatically. For manual installation:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n\nhf download theresa00l/Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-FP8-Q4_K_M-GGUF \\\n  qwen3.8-27b-uncensored-fp8-q4_k_m.gguf \\\n  --local-dir /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n\nhf download unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF \\\n  mmproj-F16.gguf \\\n  --local-dir /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n```\n\nRestart ComfyUI or refresh the node after downloading.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# RunPod templates\n\nMiniMax H3 FL2VA and Ref2VA each have two RunPod templates:\n\n- **Plus tail:** provisions the H3 generation tail.\n- **Plus QWEN prompt enhancer:** provisions the local Qwen3.8 GGUF prompt enhancer used by this workflow.\n\n## FL2VA\n\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 FL2VA plus tail](https://console.runpod.io/deploy?template=v7b5g03csk&ref=se4tkc5o)\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 FL2VA plus prompt enhancer](https://console.runpod.io/hub/template/a1nkufhzxq?ref=se4tkc5o)\n\n## Ref2VA\n\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 Ref2VA plus tail](https://console.runpod.io/deploy?template=6qtfx7lxgc&ref=se4tkc5o)\n- [Deploy MiniMax H3 Ref2VA plus prompt enhancer](https://console.runpod.io/hub/template/pcsqepl6kt?ref=se4tkc5o)\n\n# Manual Qwen3.8 prompt-enhancer download\n\nThe **plus prompt enhancer** template provisions these files automatically. For manual installation:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n\nhf download theresa00l/Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-FP8-Q4_K_M-GGUF \\\n  qwen3.8-27b-uncensored-fp8-q4_k_m.gguf \\\n  --local-dir /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n\nhf download unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF \\\n  mmproj-F16.gguf \\\n  --local-dir /workspace/ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8\n```\n\nRestart ComfyUI or refresh the node after downloading.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
